Clawdmeter (sylvain-fano fork) - licensing

This repository mixes material under three different regimes. Read all three
before you reuse anything.

1. This fork's own contributions: MIT License (below)

   The code and documentation added or changed by commits authored by
   Sylvain Fano in this repository (see `git log --author="Sylvain Fano"`),
   notably the multi-account support (firmware/src/slots.*, the account paging
   in the daemon and the hub), the S3 WiFi build, hub-extras/, docs/ai/ and
   the CI workflow.

2. Upstream code: no license granted

   Everything else was written by the authors of
   https://github.com/HermannBjorgvin/Clawdmeter and of the forks this one
   builds on (https://github.com/TheOriUHD/Clawdmeter, and the parts credited
   in README.md). Upstream deliberately publishes no license, because the
   project bundles third-party proprietary assets (see 3). Copyright in that
   code stays with its authors; this file grants no rights to it.

3. Third-party assets: not licensed, not covered by anything here

   - The Anthropic brand fonts (Tiempos, Styrene) compiled into
     firmware/src/font_tiempos_*.c and firmware/src/font_styrene_*.c, which
     upstream uses without a license. (font_mono_*.c is DejaVu Sans Mono,
     under its own free license.)
   - The Clawd mascot art and animations (firmware/src/splash_animations.h,
     firmware/src/clawd_still.h, firmware/src/logo.h,
     research/clawd-official/, assets/readme/, screenshots/), copyright
     Anthropic PBC.
   - Lucide icons (https://lucide.dev), under their own ISC/MIT license.

   Claude, Claude Code and Anthropic are trademarks of Anthropic PBC. This
   project is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Anthropic.

